# Protect Line UI generation

Before generating any visual component or page:

1. Read `DESIGN.md` at the project root
2. Use **only** CSS variables from `colors_and_type.css`
3. Reuse patterns from `components/` and `kit/index.html`
4. Follow `brand/voice.md` for copy tone

## Token rules

- Colours: `var(--color-*)` only — never hardcode hex
- Spacing: `var(--spacing-*)` only — do not invent values
- Fonts: `var(--font-primary)`, `var(--font-accent)` — never Inter/Roboto
- Radius: `var(--radius-pill)` for buttons/nav, `var(--radius-lg)` for cards

## Component rules

- Primary button: `.pl-btn-primary` (pink pill, white bold text)
- Secondary button: `.pl-btn-secondary` (navy outline pill)
- Links: `.pl-link` (pink, bold, underlined)
- Section headings: `.pl-section-heading` (white on navy block, all caps)
- Body: left-aligned, sentence case, 16px Poppins Regular

## Do not

- Add Tailwind, Bootstrap, or other CSS frameworks unless explicitly asked
- Use Title Case headings
- Use Arial for creative headings
- Add card shadows or glassmorphism
- Fear-monger in copy
